sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant C as plc compiler
    participant M as SwTrackController
    P->>UI: click Commit iteration
    UI->>S: commit()
    alt no clean RUN of this exact buffer
        S-->>UI: terminal: commit refused, and why
    else verified
        S->>W: commit(buffer, file_name)
        W->>C: compile_program(source)
        C-->>W: Program
        W->>W: diagnose again, refuse any diagnostic
        W->>W: install it, iteration + 1, keep the last 5
        W-->>S: Iteration
        S->>W: scan()
        S-->>UI: COMMITTED, file list, header
        opt every wayside on the line now has a program
            S->>M: ready (all waysides of the line)
            M-->>S: true
            UI-->>P: NOT READY cleared
            Note right of M: From the next scan the line's waysides run and report ready (UC-09, UC-17).
        end
    end
